<Layout
  title="Claude Haiku 4.5 — A.I. — Rycode"
  description="Fastest near-frontier model for cost-sensitive work and sub-agents."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">Frontier models</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Claude Haiku 4.5</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">Claude Haiku 4.5 is Anthropic’s fastest near-frontier model for cost-sensitive work and sub-agents. The API id is <code>claude-haiku-4-5-20251001</code> (alias <code>claude-haiku-4-5</code>). Pricing is $1 input and $5 output per million tokens.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Training</h2>
    <p>Anthropic lists a reliable knowledge cutoff of February 2025 and a training data cutoff of July 2025 (older than the Claude 5.x line). Parameter count, training FLOPs, and the full post-training recipe for this SKU are not published on the models overview or choosing guide.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Inference</h2>
    <p>Extended thinking is supported (not adaptive thinking). The effort parameter is not supported. Relative to the current Claude lineup, Haiku is the fastest latency class.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Context</h2>
    <p>The documented context window is 200K tokens. Max output is 64K tokens. Inputs are text and images; output is text. The model supports multilingual use, vision, and tool use.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Methods</h2>
    <p>Extended thinking plus tools are what Anthropic names for this SKU.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Benchmarking</h2>
    <p>Anthropic has not published a Haiku 4.5 score table on the models overview or choosing guide pages cited here.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Hardware</h2>
    <p>Anthropic trains and runs Claude on AWS Trainium, Google TPUs, and NVIDIA GPUs. Amazon is the primary cloud and training partner. Anthropic reported more than 1 million Trainium2 chips in use as of April 2026. Per-SKU serving silicon is not published. Buyers purchase API tokens, not a named Claude GPU SKU.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Access and pricing</h2>
    <p>Pricing is $1 input and $5 output per million tokens.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/overview">Models overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/choosing-a-model">Choosing a model</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-amazon-compute">Amazon compute partnership (20 Apr 2026)</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/google-broadcom-partnership-compute">Google/Broadcom compute partnership (6 Apr 2026)</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
